  unitName: Iron Shield Darvan
  unitId: 30353
  unitNumber: 536
  description: A mild-mannered general of the Principality of Vriksha, who spent
    ages protecting the throne from the calamity of war. An excellent warrior, he
    was trusted by royalty and vassals alike. Some say that the otherworldly gunslinger
    Douglas was allowed to run wild because of Darvan's protection. He forged his
    greenish armor out of some materials he found deep in the woods, though even
    he was unaware of their secret capabilities.
  summonDesc: Summoner!<br>Say no more.<br>My powers are yours.
  fusionDesc: Strength from others...<br>I won't say no, but<br>I'll have to think
    about it.
